{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_reckpr_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_reckpr_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"何须剑","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_reckpr_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"be2ad87a7dc546e584d92b7d404a3cb33bb4ad4d34d4dbf21e7f002c94dee19d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"云青萍救下了一位欲复仇的老人，并成了那位古稀老人的师父。“仇恨”还是“豁达”，用言语说不清的道理又如何用武功来言说？","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低头看包扎过的伤口）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我竟然得人相救，没有死......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"受伤的老人挣扎下床，抓起自己的剑。\n他四下寻找，想要向屋子的主人答谢救命之恩。环视一圈，只见屋中朴素干净，简帙齐整，此屋主想必是极为认真之人。\n桌上摊开着一本笔记，老人被其笔法吸引，不由上前翻看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好稳的笔法。此人笔锋竟看不出一丝虚浮，如非书法家，定是位沉淀了数十年的高手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......《问武》——“十载录遍天下武，更觉意邈不知处。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人翻了一页，花白的胡子顿时翘起。\n那是一些精准的人体画，画的场面他这辈子都不会忘记——正是他被仇敌击下山崖的那场对决！\n画旁的注解尖锐地指出了他应对那一记阴招的失策，甚至给出了一个堪称精妙的解法。老人顿觉脸红脑热，一口气压抑在胸口不得纾解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人扶着墙快步而出。只见屋外一条小河，河上悬一条麻绳，麻绳上一位年轻人正迎面走来，而麻绳不曾晃动。\n那年轻人背着手，提着菜，习以为常地走过麻绳，仿佛这只是他日常锻炼的一环。年轻人见了老人，便向他走来，显然是此间屋主。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您醒了，老前辈，身体感觉怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......和那畜生是什么关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是不是误会了？我与您素不相识，我是在进山散步时看到了从山崖上掉下来的您，见您昏迷不醒，这才把您带回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说谎，我与那畜生对决的时候你明明就在场！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您是说我在录武簿上记的招式？抱歉，我冒昧地推测了当时的情形......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推测？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您手上的剑茧，纤长的手臂肌肉和发达的跟腱，还有剑上的使用痕迹都会告诉我您使用招式的习惯，再结合您身上的伤即可知晓大概。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾在军中录武多年，不过是些雕虫小技。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么说来，是我误会了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......对不住了。老朽陈锈清，是山上那间剑馆的主人。不知恩人如何称呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚辈姓云，名青萍，是工作之余，出来游历修心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修心，嗯......只不过，年轻人若是沉迷于纸上谈兵，怕是要耽误了真正的修行。你需知道，你写的应对之招，只在纸面上可行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈了解自己的剑，说得自然没错。挥出那一剑时人的重心已偏移，再加上剑本身的重量，是不可能刺到咽喉的位置的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，要使您的剑锋恰好落在要害处，也只需做一个小改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵！你说说，我要做什么改变？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈所使的剑外形奇特，剑尖比一般的剑更重。您或已习惯，并未觉不妥，但试试看，将食指勾到剑格上呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"异想天开！你以为用剑的手势是这么容易改变的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要数年，甚至十数年的练习。我只告诉您可行性，做不做由您自己决定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈锈清一脸狐疑，却又思索着走开了。片刻，屋后传来舞剑声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"舞剑声停，旋即又响，再停，似是那人在仔细琢磨。突然，只见他提着剑跌跌撞撞地走过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎知可行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑的重心只改变了一毫，但许多对决，差的只是那一毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如此年纪，受不住......也给我受着！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一拜，为救命之恩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而这一拜......"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈锈清梗着脖子，好似逼着自己低头，挣扎许久，发出悲痛一叹，终于又低头一拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请收我这老剑客为徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈，何必跟着我过来。河边潮湿，对伤不好。拜师之事，也请不要再提，已与您解释了很多遍，我不过行录武之事，怎敢自称为师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里看了你半天，你在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捉鳞，也观鳞。鳞水一体，以眼观心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早说嘛！都浮上来了，我去给您捞。年轻......师父，您要几条？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈......我这块田间的杂草......都去了哪里？您的伤势又如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！年轻人果然还是爱偷懒啊。不用谢，帮您把杂草都清了，水也挑来了。我这把老骨头硬朗得很，还有什么要做的，尽管开口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈，您坐，我们聊聊吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"云青萍默默放下卷起的衣袖，不得不放弃了锄草锻炼身体的计划。他坐在光秃秃的田里叹了口气，问出了那个之前故意不提的问题——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈您......为何定要拜我为师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。啧......唉！那我也坦白与你说吧。士可杀不可辱，我有仇要报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遭我信任的徒儿背叛。我对那畜生倾囊相授，他却为了五斗米折腰，毁我剑馆名声，就为了逼我将那块地皮卖他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是再年轻二十年，不，十年，哪还轮得到那畜生对我出手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈提升了剑法，又将如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管他使没使阴招，败在他手下便是我陈某技不如人，我认了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，此仇不报，我怎咽得下这口气，又怎么在江湖上立足？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老前辈想跟我学的，是复仇剑法。我恐怕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，孩子，药里加了止疼剂，喝完后就不会疼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，这病房里平时只有我，不用总是咬牙忍痛的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（喝下苦药）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是勇敢的孩子。睡吧，好好睡觉，才能好起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大夫......我的父母都被歹人害死了，从此以后，只有我一人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了，你试着用一把剑救你的父母，却被歹人击落到田埂里......你一直撑到了宗师找到你，坚强的孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以后，须得自己照顾自己了......关于我的伤，您能不能......对我说实话，我真的还能好起来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然......大概率。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好起来以后，我会怎么样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......好吧。你可放心，你的伤不致命，好起来以后应该还能站起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但即便能走动，体质也会比常人弱。你今后要把身体当作雨中的沙堡一样保护。对常人无害的运动、碰撞，都可能使沙堡坍塌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。多谢......您的实话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（咬牙忍住）（无声地啜泣起来）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......本来都好好的......他们来之前，都还好好的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩童用他那无力的拳头捶着床，发泄着愤恨，一下又一下，纱布重新染血，而他似不觉痛。\n军医无言，在承担悲惨命运的人面前，旁人的任何语言都是苍白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门军医","speakerId":"avg_npc_1640_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，你听外面的声音，是宗师带兵回来了。我听说他们俘虏了袭击你家人的那一窝歹人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"云青萍顿时挣扎着要坐起来。看到他愤怒的目光，军医不禁上前扶住他，想助他亲眼看到仇敌伏法。\n然而，当他真的勉强坐起时，他似又想到了什么，犹豫再三后，缓缓扭过头，对着墙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"童年云青萍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。我不要看......如果这伤要疼一辈子......我不要每次疼的时候，都想起他们的脸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小师父？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈？是......我说梦话惊扰了您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁没一两段不想说的往事，我什么都没听见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......往事不可复，但求来者犹可追。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘟囔什么呢，没事的话我继续去睡了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈既然非要喊我一声师父，我就斗胆应了吧，只是您需答应我一件事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说您说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"习剑期间，不可拿起您那把剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，习剑不用剑？！我教人剑法教了一辈子，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您现在，姑且是我的学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"narration","text":"修习第一日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈，腰，第三次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一脸不服地收腰）为了报仇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，腰一动，腿的动作就不对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（额角青筋暴突）忍了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“剑尖”下坠了。重新计时吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是根棍儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心中有剑，何必在意剑形——腿，又不对了。重新计时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又重新？！你这人，说话软绵绵的，手段怎么这么狠！这一套都跟谁学的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武学这许多道理，统统是跟我的老师——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说这些折磨人的法子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意形一体，同宗同源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！看来，在那位不讲道理的老师手下，你可没少吃苦头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道老前辈说的是玩笑话。不过，我的老师的确从不“讲”道理。毕竟，越是重要的道理，越没法“讲”明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他都是让我，自己从武学里去悟的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"青萍，腰，挺直。借腰之力将剑向前送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"气息又乱了。需要休息了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我还能坚持的。老师叫我来参与操练，我本该感激不尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的心中，可有疑问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，有。老师难道不觉得，我这样的人，站在这演武场上显得格格不入？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别人挥舞着大刀巨斧，老师却只叫我举着一根小树枝作剑。别人对着木人大削大砍，我却只需要用这根又轻又小的枯枝戳这块大石头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"固然，我的手能举起的只有区区一根枯枝，但这枯枝脆弱不堪，稍一用力，便会被折断，被捏成齑粉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师却要我用一根枯枝推动这块比我的腰还高的石头。我日日在此处，仅练习这一件事......何尝不是在做无用功？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我如何能寄希望于用一根枯枝去推动巨石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本该早些与你说清。我教你的时候，可曾有怠慢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，未曾有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师的意思是......您是真的相信，我做得到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水行石上，风过山岗，何曾有事物能挡了它们的道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水行石上，风过山岗......可是，究竟......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。水行石上，而非与石头硬碰硬。推动这块石头，用的一定是柔劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以腿带腰，以腰带臂......啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风过山岗，老师的意思一定是，须使出轻盈的巧劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"气沉丹田，观其弱点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！嘶......手指撞肿了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"断了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又断了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三个月了......这枯槁老木！这......冥顽不化的石头！这......不争气的胳膊！该死的强盗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"区区枯枝，痴心妄想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啜泣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"天公不作美，雨点不留情。少年冷静下来，抹抹眼泪，迎着雨又拾了一根枯枝，走向那块与他较劲了三个月而不为所动的大石头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下盘，腰，手。借腰之力，向前送——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下盘，腰，手。推。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年云青萍","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨，越来越大。少年听着雨声，内心不知何时平静了下来。他如往常那般专注于自身，并未注意到积水已没过他的鞋底。\n被水浸湿的泥土踩上去感觉很陌生，枯枝的手感也略有不同。他在雨中体会着这一切。\n水行石上，润其下土。借力而发，力到——\n石移。\n少年睁开了眼。就在刚才，这块磐石因他动了几不可察的一分。他抬头，迎着无边际的天、吞山河的雨。他笑这块石头也没那么了不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"narration","text":"修习一月后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈的技法已入新境。明日起，将棍棒换回您的剑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起先您总是打磨那把剑，这几日却未曾见您照料它了。今晚，不如就将它拿出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，我继续用这根棍，顺手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，您的手最终要与剑同步同调......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先打磨杀性，着眼剑法本身——你起初叫我丢开那把剑，不是这个意思？我乐意再打磨打磨，你不必管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"narration","text":"修习数月后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又在观鳞。腾出位置做什么，我不爱看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看腻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流水载鳞，千变万化，当我知道你在河边看些什么的时候，我都看醉了，又怎么会看腻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过每次看入了神，那每一片树叶的颤动，每一丝河水的涟漪，天地万物，都往我老眼里钻，太费神了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真佩服你，看得这么专注，却还这么平心静气。师父到底是师父，我还差得远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老前辈，可否为我捞一尾鳞来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这有何难？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那位老人说着，却并未一掌劈向水面，而是跪坐下来，仔细观察起水流。云青萍微笑起来。\n以水观鳞，知鳞之所向。顺流轻触——鳞轻轻跃入云青萍身侧的桶中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抚掌）老前辈——这一尾鳞，便是我们的告别礼。今日起，我已没有东西可以教您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"云青萍","speakerId":"avg_4196_reckpr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修心治身，接下来的路，谁都教不得，得您自己走。我离开自小长大的地方时，我的老师也是这么对我说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......修心，治身。好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈锈清","speakerId":"avg_npc_1639_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，此番别去，可就江湖不见了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"云青萍听后并不意外，向他颔首笑着致意。老人向云青萍长长一揖，隐隐已有超然之风。\n他朗笑而去，走入深林不见了踪影。平时充斥着习武声的屋子，如今已空荡荡。\n屋主安坐片刻，便也起身，带了为数不多的几样东西，再次踏上了四处游历之路。只留了一把老剑，倚在斜阳里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
